She said that he said that she said that mm42@prism.gatech.EDU (Mark Mitchell) said:
-Two questions about Nethack 3.0:
-
-What is a helm of brilliance?  I wore one for a while and it didn't seem
-to do anything special.

It adds one to both your INT and WIS.  Personally, I think it should also
light up a room for you, a la the late lamented ring of illumination.

-What is a wand of cancellation good for?  (I know, I know, CANCELLING.  But
-I mean what does it cancel?)

It cancels out a monster's special effects.  Thus, it turns a rust monster
into something similar to a moving boulder.  I'm not sure if it cancels
*all* of the special effects with one blast, but it will turn all your
potions into water, turn your scrolls into blank scrolls, remove all charges
from your wands, and (I believe) disenchant your armor if cast upon yourself.

